WEBVTT

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:36.680
Parental supervision is advised for children under the age of 13

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:45.140
Man’s snowy path is cleared by wind, while Beasts seek refuge in the woods.

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:49.140
The Demon’s discord blazes bright, while Spirits on the mountain roam.

00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:53.100
The dawn begets meditation, the noon-time bell calls all to work,

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:57.270
in evening there is wisdom found, and the nighttime drums guide lost souls home.

00:00:57.810 --> 00:01:01.220
The fog lifts and Man awakes,

00:01:01.220 --> 00:01:04.100
as the mountain rises above the clouds.

00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:09.640
The Five Virtues shape the circle of life,

00:01:09.640 --> 00:01:14.310
yet their justice may be hollow.

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:31.640
Good and evil tread the same path,

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:33.770
and there is wisdom in the words of mortals,

00:01:33.770 --> 00:01:35.890
yet Heaven and Earth pay little heed,

00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:37.890
for they trivialize mortals' passions.

00:01:37.890 --> 00:01:39.890
Man, Demon, Beasts, and Spirits have all said:

00:01:39.890 --> 00:01:41.810
We of Ying and Yang bear no power,

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:43.520
yet Heaven’s rule holds no permanence,

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:46.520
and the Ten Celestial Branches shall emerge from the chaos.

00:01:46.770 --> 00:01:52.770
Can evil’s demise be considered justice?

00:01:53.720 --> 00:02:00.220
The stars shall bear witness and judge.

00:02:18.520 --> 00:02:24.180
Episode 3 - The Great Seal

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:32.100
Ugh... my head.

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:45.020
That vision again.

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:47.520
Why do I keep having these dreams?

00:04:05.310 --> 00:04:06.770
Dad? You're awake.

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:14.220
Please, pour me a glass of water.

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:15.640
Okay, just a moment.

00:04:24.930 --> 00:04:25.970
Here.

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:37.060
My Fifth, Sixth, and Seventh brothers...

00:04:37.060 --> 00:04:39.350
How are they?

00:04:39.350 --> 00:04:41.390
Fifth and Seventh Uncle's injuries were light.

00:04:41.390 --> 00:04:43.100
They're inside recovering.

00:04:43.640 --> 00:04:45.390
But... Sixth Uncle...

00:04:45.390 --> 00:04:47.140
What happened to him?!

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:49.020
Sixth Uncle, he...

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:53.770
Sixth...

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:26.180
Over half of the village is dead...

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:28.140
and it's all due to this monster right here.

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:31.970
This...

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:34.470
How do we even deal with the remains of this monster?

00:05:34.470 --> 00:05:36.180
Burn it?

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:37.060
No good.

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:39.140
What if the fumes are toxic?

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:41.930
Then...

00:05:41.930 --> 00:05:44.140
Let's just wait for the village chief to make a decision.

00:05:45.390 --> 00:05:47.020
I suppose that's all we can do.

00:05:49.470 --> 00:05:52.140
Master Chi, Elder Dao, you've returned.

00:05:52.470 --> 00:05:53.470
Yes.

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:15.230
It's... vanished...

00:06:15.230 --> 00:06:17.390
Master Chi... you...

00:06:20.180 --> 00:06:22.180
Third brother, where is he?

00:06:23.100 --> 00:06:25.430
The village chief is resting in his home at the moment.

00:06:26.810 --> 00:06:28.520
Continue to take care of things here.

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:30.270
Yes, Master Chi.

00:06:31.270 --> 00:06:34.180
Master Chi seems... kind of different.

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:35.640
Mmm...

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:57.930
Yu Dan

00:07:25.430 --> 00:07:26.810
Yu Qing

00:07:26.810 --> 00:07:29.020
These dried fruits... we're returning them to you.

00:07:33.810 --> 00:07:35.230
It's all because of that demon...

00:07:35.230 --> 00:07:36.180
that Dan was…

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:39.560
Sorry!

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:43.310
-Sorry

00:08:03.180 --> 00:08:04.310
Dad,

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:06.180
why would the monsters attack us?

00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:08.520
The thing inside the inner chambers...

00:08:08.520 --> 00:08:09.890
were they looking for that?

00:08:11.140 --> 00:08:13.060
Also, what the Mountain Sage said...

00:08:13.060 --> 00:08:14.060
At this point,

00:08:17.270 --> 00:08:20.100
There's no reason to keep you in the dark.

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:22.980
3 years ago,

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:26.560
a devastating plague struck the village.

00:08:28.140 --> 00:08:30.390
This plague also caused…

00:08:31.140 --> 00:08:33.640
your memory loss from 3 years back.

00:08:35.560 --> 00:08:37.230
At that time,

00:08:37.230 --> 00:08:40.230
more than half of the village was struck by the disease.

00:08:42.890 --> 00:08:45.730
We were desperate to find a cure,

00:08:46.390 --> 00:08:48.480
trying various herbs and remedies,

00:08:48.480 --> 00:08:49.980
all to no avail.

00:08:51.640 --> 00:08:53.980
What we felt was carved into our memory...

00:08:54.810 --> 00:08:57.350
it was hell on earth.

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:03.980
Hopelessness and despair followed us constantly.

00:09:05.430 --> 00:09:07.180
At that moment,

00:09:07.180 --> 00:09:08.980
a young demon suddenly appeared.

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:13.140
A scale of his fell serendipitously into the village well.

00:09:13.810 --> 00:09:17.520
After drinking the water, the villagers were completely cured.

00:09:19.680 --> 00:09:21.230
You can probably guess...

00:09:22.060 --> 00:09:23.770
what happened after that.

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:27.600
So his scales were the Panacea?

00:09:28.430 --> 00:09:29.180
Yes.

00:09:33.430 --> 00:09:35.520
So... I've eaten it too.

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:44.390
Third Brother.

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:46.270
Big Brother!

00:09:47.390 --> 00:09:49.560
Eldest Uncle, Second Uncle, you've returned.

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:55.180
You... your faces.

00:09:57.600 --> 00:09:59.980
We heard word, and returned as swiftly as possible.

00:10:13.810 --> 00:10:15.520
What exactly happened?

00:10:15.520 --> 00:10:18.140
We hear the young demon has been taken.

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:20.600
Ah... yes.

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:26.060
The Panacea we've developed may not only cure any disease,

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:28.020
but also empower the strength of demons.

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:30.930
I don't know why...

00:10:30.930 --> 00:10:33.020
those who took the Panacea...

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:34.520
all suddenly became demons.

00:10:35.350 --> 00:10:38.890
And after the Peacock Demon absorbed their miasmic qi,

00:10:38.890 --> 00:10:41.350
his form, and even demeanor changed.

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:44.100
Even that fire wielder...

00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:47.850
Even he had trouble dealing with the demon after that.

00:10:49.810 --> 00:10:51.810
If things really are like this...

00:10:51.810 --> 00:10:53.810
I fear...

00:10:53.810 --> 00:10:55.810
we may all become but food for the demons.

00:10:56.890 --> 00:10:57.930
Fire wielder?

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:01.890
The Fire Aspect of the Shrouded Mountain.

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:03.350
It was him who took the young demon away.

00:11:05.810 --> 00:11:08.100
This news cannot reach the ears of demons.

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:10.680
We must quickly retrieve it.

00:11:12.180 --> 00:11:15.770
But... not even the Peacock demon was able to defeat the fire wielder.

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:17.730
Rushing to get it back...

00:11:17.730 --> 00:11:19.640
Isn't that too risky?

00:11:21.930 --> 00:11:23.810
Mountain Sage's parting words...

00:11:23.810 --> 00:11:27.020
They probably have something to do with this young demon.

00:11:27.020 --> 00:11:29.600
I have to figure out what exactly is going on.

00:11:30.060 --> 00:11:31.560
Actually, Eldest Uncle,

00:11:31.560 --> 00:11:33.560
I've talked with the fire wielder before.

00:11:34.310 --> 00:11:36.560
Why don't I go and take back the little demon?

00:11:39.850 --> 00:11:41.060
Oh?

00:11:41.060 --> 00:11:41.890
You know each other?

00:11:41.890 --> 00:11:42.520
Yes.

00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:45.020
We can give it a try.

00:11:47.230 --> 00:11:48.230
Third Brother,

00:11:48.230 --> 00:11:49.390
don't worry, and get some rest.

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:53.890
Ze Qi,

00:11:53.890 --> 00:11:55.430
go with Xiao,

00:11:55.430 --> 00:11:57.390
and bring back the demon.

00:11:57.600 --> 00:11:59.140
Leave a trail in the dirt.

00:12:00.430 --> 00:12:02.350
Once we're used to these bodies,

00:12:04.140 --> 00:12:05.310
we'll join you.

00:12:41.230 --> 00:12:42.430
What?

00:12:42.430 --> 00:12:44.100
The Beast of Wrath is dead?

00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:51.600
How many years has it been?

00:12:52.140 --> 00:12:54.230
It's because we're demons...

00:12:54.230 --> 00:12:55.850
and they're humans.

00:12:56.810 --> 00:13:01.480
Under the decree of the gods, we've been confined to this accursed place.

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:06.270
Why the hell are they allowed to enjoy the natural bounty of the earth?

00:13:06.270 --> 00:13:07.310
Yet we...

00:13:07.810 --> 00:13:12.230
We must stay jailed deep in the fiery bowels of the earth?

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:14.600
This is an outrage,

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:16.770
an OUTRAGE!

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:19.430
But now...

00:13:19.430 --> 00:13:22.390
The lost Qilin has finally been found.

00:13:22.890 --> 00:13:24.390
With him...

00:13:24.390 --> 00:13:26.770
we will return to our former glory.

00:13:26.770 --> 00:13:28.480
Break the seal,

00:13:28.890 --> 00:13:31.140
slay those accursed Five Aspects,

00:13:31.140 --> 00:13:32.730
and reclaim our freedom!

00:14:56.770 --> 00:14:58.180
Anxious Tail,

00:14:58.180 --> 00:14:59.980
Corner Shadow,

00:14:59.980 --> 00:15:01.270
Mountain Store...

00:15:03.100 --> 00:15:05.140
The sacred beast...

00:15:05.180 --> 00:15:08.100
Bring it back!

00:17:11.770 --> 00:17:13.390
Who am I?

00:17:13.390 --> 00:17:14.850
Where am I?

00:17:14.850 --> 00:17:16.270
Who was I fighting with?

00:17:31.390 --> 00:17:35.180
Yep yep yep, go, start swimming
(idk who this is referring to, it's either him or him telling someone else)

00:20:57.640 --> 00:21:02.560
Rhino's Scream vs. The Mystic Forest

00:21:03.060 --> 00:21:07.520
The story will come to a close, looking forward to seeing you again.
